    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bI apologize for the inconvenience caused by the stutter and delay when switching weapons. Please set the framerate to 60 FPS in the game settings to alleviate the issue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe game allows for custom buttons, including the controller and keyboard and mouse, and the controller has vibration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bIf the controller does not respond, please follow the following settings: right-click the game name \u2192 Properties \u2192 Controller \u2192 Use default settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SLASHING NIGHT is an action game developed and published by YUGIKOBO, paying tribute to high-speed action games such as Devil May Cry and Bayonetta, and striving to restore their operability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: Players can quickly switch weapons in the game and perform air or ground combos. The game allows custom buttons and supports controllers and keyboards and mice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill system: Players must enter the skill menu to learn skills to obtain the desired abilities. Magic shields and perfect dodges can slow down the enemy's movements and provide opportunities for counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat features: Use stomping on enemies, double jumps, teleportation, and air dodges to perform gorgeous air combos. Use energy to release high-damage skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to provide a fast-paced combat experience, combining a rich combat system and skill learning mechanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic shield and perfect dodge can slow down the enemy's movements. Take this opportunity to counterattack the enemy!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/cf7da4c4118abef00c3c7f39c2dd7d16.poster.avif?t=1749139167\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/cf7da4c4118abef00c3c7f39c2dd7d16.webm?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/cf7da4c4118abef00c3c7f39c2dd7d16.mp4?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/afd79619de6c0d3ed93763f0c3fb4fe0.poster.avif?t=1749139167\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/afd79619de6c0d3ed93763f0c3fb4fe0.webm?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/afd79619de6c0d3ed93763f0c3fb4fe0.mp4?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/e57aeb9566052e20b1af437df113cdcf.poster.avif?t=1749139167\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/e57aeb9566052e20b1af437df113cdcf.webm?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/e57aeb9566052e20b1af437df113cdcf.mp4?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stepping on enemies, double jump, teleport, and air dodge to perform gorgeous aerial combos. Aerial attacks can increase the damage rate more easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/842ff2567e03a5276fc3305462f8a561.poster.avif?t=1749139167\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/842ff2567e03a5276fc3305462f8a561.webm?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/842ff2567e03a5276fc3305462f8a561.mp4?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume energy to release high-damage skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/089dd554874fef05448822f4dd68d8fc.poster.avif?t=1749139167\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/089dd554874fef05448822f4dd68d8fc.webm?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/089dd554874fef05448822f4dd68d8fc.mp4?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between different weapons and perform gorgeous combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/5846805fb69ad329b4a06f4ff0aecf8b.poster.avif?t=1749139167\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/5846805fb69ad329b4a06f4ff0aecf8b.webm?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/5846805fb69ad329b4a06f4ff0aecf8b.mp4?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/2fa4d0eb8a7d35c091b3723397789aa4.poster.avif?t=1749139167\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/2fa4d0eb8a7d35c091b3723397789aa4.webm?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/2fa4d0eb8a7d35c091b3723397789aa4.mp4?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bI apologize for the inconvenience caused by the stutter and delay when switching weapons. Please set the framerate to 60 FPS in the game settings to alleviate the issue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe game allows for custom buttons, including the controller and keyboard and mouse, and the controller has vibration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bIf the controller does not respond, please follow the following settings: right-click the game name \u2192 Properties \u2192 Controller \u2192 Use default settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SLASHING NIGHT is an action game developed and published by YUGIKOBO, paying tribute to high-speed action games such as Devil May Cry and Bayonetta, and striving to restore their operability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: Players can quickly switch weapons in the game and perform air or ground combos. The game allows custom buttons and supports controllers and keyboards and mice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill system: Players must enter the skill menu to learn skills to obtain the desired abilities. Magic shields and perfect dodges can slow down the enemy's movements and provide opportunities for counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat features: Use stomping on enemies, double jumps, teleportation, and air dodges to perform gorgeous air combos. Use energy to release high-damage skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to provide a fast-paced combat experience, combining a rich combat system and skill learning mechanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic shield and perfect dodge can slow down the enemy's movements. Take this opportunity to counterattack the enemy!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/cf7da4c4118abef00c3c7f39c2dd7d16.poster.avif?t=1749139167\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/cf7da4c4118abef00c3c7f39c2dd7d16.webm?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/cf7da4c4118abef00c3c7f39c2dd7d16.mp4?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/afd79619de6c0d3ed93763f0c3fb4fe0.poster.avif?t=1749139167\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/afd79619de6c0d3ed93763f0c3fb4fe0.webm?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/afd79619de6c0d3ed93763f0c3fb4fe0.mp4?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/e57aeb9566052e20b1af437df113cdcf.poster.avif?t=1749139167\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/e57aeb9566052e20b1af437df113cdcf.webm?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291030/extras/e57aeb9566052e20b1af437df113cdcf.mp4?t=1749139167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stepping on enemies, double jump, teleport, and air dodge to perform gorgeous aerial combos. Aerial attacks can increase the damage rate more easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><sp